decision CORRECT based_on STAGE, REPRODUCTION, INFERENCE, ALTERNATIVES, UNKNOWN:
  "Change only auth smoke V2 fixture creation to isolated fixture SQL within the smoke script, with typed canonical generation content and existing cleanup. Do not import the test-only helper into operational scripts. Add module responsibility comment. Run existing auth/migration regression and normal V3 writer rejection regression; add both to awareness CI command. Record source-cause and detection improvement. Preserve cleanup, real authentication, SSE, normal writer restrictions, public release gates and held V3 cutover. Integrate scoped new PR and immutable rc5 through required checks before repeat Stage. Do not claim completion before public normal battle evidence."
